WEBVTT

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.010
It sure is shiny.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.620
Seems Grandma bought it for you.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.560
I had to use your hand-me-down 
backpack when I started school.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.050
Why don't you go take a look in the mirror?

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.360
Renge, where are you going?

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.790
For a walk!

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:13.900
This is my village.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.930
It's a quiet, peaceful place.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:22.080
Starting this spring, I'll be 
this village's one and only...

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:34.990
...bright, shiny first grader!

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.450
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.450
<b>I Became a First Grader</b>

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:19.880
Oh, Renge, you're already up?

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:21.510
I am.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.640
Why are you wearing your backpack?

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:27.130
A backpack is something you wear.

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.470
Putting it on your head 
would be bad manners.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:30.850
That's not what I meant.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:34.150
I'm off!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.770
She's cutting it close, as usual.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.190
Oh, yum! It's full of strawberries!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.240
Nee-nee made the jam yesterday.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.280
Thank you for breakfast.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.820
I'm going now!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.610
Going where?

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:47.840
To school!

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.330
The entrance ceremony is tomorrow.

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:52.210
I'm practicing going to school!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.490
Hika-nee, I found the legendary sword!

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:11.600
That's a stick.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.550
It's not a stick!

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:15.990
The weight, the branch-like shape...

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.990
It's obviously the legendary sword!

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:19.940
You just called it a branch.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:23.760
What're you doing?

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:25.490
Marking the path.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.320
Now we can find our way 
home even if we get lost.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.120
You could find your way 
home alone from here.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.280
You just don't get it, Hika-nee.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.790
You never know what will 
happen in this day and age.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.250
Asahigaoka
Bus Stop

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.250
Hi.

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.500
Hey, what brings you two out here?

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.090
Is something going on today?

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:44.930
Renge wants to check out the school 
before the entrance ceremony.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.670
I'm rehearsing!

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.720
Oh, so that's why you even 
have your backpack on.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.480
Nattsun, look.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:53.320
Whoa! It's the legendary sword!

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:55.310
I marked the path with it.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:57.320
I'm impressed you know the name.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:58.960
I should. I taught it to her.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.150
That was your idea?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.610
We're on our way to the school, too.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.160
Then could you take Renge with you?

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.480
I've got packing to do, 
since I'm going to Tokyo.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.230
You're lucky, Hika-nee!

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:11.800
High school in Tokyo, huh?

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.120
Oh, there's the bus.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.760
Renge, here.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:19.910
Money?

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:20.820
For the bus.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.120
Starting in April, you have 
to pay the child fare.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.600
Hey, when did Nii-chan get on?

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:05.840
Yep, she's asleep.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.420
Well, it is a warm day.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:17.410
Be careful not to sleep 
through the stop tomorrow.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:20.350
You'll have to get a commuter pass 
once you start school, too, Renge.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:23.190
I'll get a commuter pass, too!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.380
Asahigaoka Branch School

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.320
Please take care of me from tomorrow on!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.840
Remember to fasten it next time.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.470
You'd have been in trouble 
if you'd had books in there.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:01.230
It's different now that I'll 
be coming here every day.

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.690
You guys are used to this, huh?

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:08.700
Well, I've been coming here for seven 
years now, counting elementary school.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.760
I guess it's six years for me.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:13.990
You're going back to your 
first year now, though.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.160
Of middle school.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.410
You have your entrance ceremony 
tomorrow, too, Nattsun?

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:22.010
Yep. Feels weird to be entering the 
school I graduated from, though.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.460
Yeah.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:25.960
Koma-chan.

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.300
Hey! Don't call me Koma-chan!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.170
What is it?

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.920
What do you do at an entrance ceremony?

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:35.260
Um, you listen to the principal's speech,

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.490
then they call the new students' names,

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.270
you sing the school song, and that's about it.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.460
They're gonna call my name?

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.100
Sure.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:42.770
How?

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.270
Uh, Miyauchi Renge-san?

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.630
Renge-san?!

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.530
Wow! It sounds like a grown-up name!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.150
What do I do when they call it?

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.960
You just respond.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.620
I know! I'll rehearse my response!

00:07:57.020 --> 00:08:00.070
Nattsun, call out my name for me!

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:00.850
Ren-chon.

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:03.830
Not like that! Make it sound more grown-up!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.500
Miyauchi Renge-san.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.710
Make it sound more proper!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.260
Miyauchi Renge-sama?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.570
Say it more formally!

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.930
Miyauchi Renge-dono!

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.070
Where's your response?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.570
<b>Grade 8 Class 1</b>

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.570
<b>+ Grade 1 
+ Grade 7 
+ Grade 9</b>

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:38.420
You probably know, but 
this is our classroom.

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:39.860
There are numbers added on.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:42.540
I'm in eighth grade, Natsumi's in seventh,

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.660
and our brother's in ninth.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.250
Oh, Ren-chon came with you?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.380
I did.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.430
Morning.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.680
Good morning!

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:51.710
Morning.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:55.020
Oh, Ren-chon, you can't go 
in the classroom, okay?

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.210
Why not?

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.720
That's a surprise for tomorrow.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.130
Go on and play. We'll come get 
you when it's time to leave.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.350
Leave your backpack here.

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:05.350
Oh, Ren-chon, the buckets on 
the floor are to catch leaks.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.610
The floor around them is rotten, so if 
you get too close, you'll fall through.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.310
Okay.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:12.280
No idiot has ever fallen through 
the floor before, though.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.570
I can't see my mark all the way over there.

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:44.540
Can I really become a first grader?

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:05.900
I can't believe I'm leaving for Tokyo today.

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:08.600
I'm getting kinda nervous.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.640
Tokyo is amazing!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.350
I wanna go see it, too!

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:15.070
I think you're a little young yet.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:19.780
But instead, I'll take pictures of Tokyo 
Tower to show you next time I'm home.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.100
Did you get a camera?

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:24.240
You can't take pictures without a camera.

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:28.500
Actually, I can. With this...

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.290
...cell phone!

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:34.340
A cell phone?! When did 
you get a cell phone?!

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.730
Mom and Dad bought it 
so I can keep in touch.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:44.800
If you're going to Tokyo, 
you've gotta have a cell phone or two.

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.160
With one of those, you can 
take pictures and lots more.

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.220
They can do everything.

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.600
Everything?

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.610
Then I wanna make it so all the 
whales in the world can fly—

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.570
Sorry. They can't do <i>everything</i>.

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:00.180
Hikage, you didn't forget anything, did you?

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:00.840
Nope.

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:02.450
Got your handkerchief and tissues?

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.790
I'm all set.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:05.780
I double checked to make 
sure I had everything.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:08.120
And make sure you eat right.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:08.960
I know.

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:10.250
There's the train!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.670
Well, take care.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:22.930
Yep.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:30.770
Renge, don't get so lonely you 
start crying after I'm gone.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.790
I'll be fine! I won't cry!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:34.600
Oh, yeah?

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:36.820
I'm off, then.

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:41.600
Hika-nee! Hika-nee!

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.180
That Renge...

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.740
Hika-nee! Hika-nee!

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.280
She just said she wouldn't get lonely.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:50.310
You forgot your cell phone!

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:53.250
Stop the train! My cell phone!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.620
It hasn't even had a chance to 
show a single bar of service yet!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.720
My cell phone!

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:11.000
And Hikage's gone.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.270
We'll send her cell phone to her later.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.270
Well, ready to head home?

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.200
How's the size?

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:34.790
Well, I wouldn't really 
know, but I guess it fits.

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.100
You're lucky you get to wear a new uniform.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:41.250
When I outgrow it and you get 
taller, you can have it.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:42.880
Hand-me-downs from my baby sister?

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.260
Can't help it if I'm bigger than you.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:51.640
But with Ren-chon starting, 
there'll be a student younger than me.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.030
Oh, yeah.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:56.050
You think Renge will call me "Senpai?"

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:58.190
Nee-chan, grab that manga for me.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:01.700
Ren-chon.

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.850
Oh, you were getting ready for tomorrow?

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:06.160
Perfect timing.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:10.240
I brought your outfit for 
tomorrow's entrance ceremony.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:15.760
Nee-nee, is that haute couture?

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:16.550
Huh?

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.900
Is it haute couture?

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.360
Is that outfit haute couture?

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.410
Uh...

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:25.130
Oh, yeah. It sure is.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.560
What is haute couture?!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:30.960
Sorry. I have no idea.

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:38.560
Oh, right.

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:40.560
Here's your commuter pass.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:46.610
You'll probably ride with Mom 
and Dad in the car tomorrow,

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:47.900
but I wanted to grab it before I forgot.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.560
Nee-nee...

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:53.830
I want to go by myself tomorrow.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.000
What? You can't go by yourself...

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.330
I practiced today! I can do it!

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.580
Are you sure?

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:07.880
All right. Now, why don't we get some sleep?

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:00.750
My mark on the path is almost gone...

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:29.840
105th Entrance Ceremony

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.190
Morning, Renge.

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.890
Congratulations on Your Enrollment

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:42.500
What's this?

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:45.600
It's a congratulatory flower that 
all the new first-years wear.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.690
Let's go, Ren-chon.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.650
Natsumi
Renge

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.650
Congratulations on Joining

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:02.640
Renge!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.350
Look, this is your desk.

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:06.540
Come sit down.

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:27.900
We're ready to start the entrance ceremony.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.370
First-year, Miyauchi Renge-san.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:46.000
Yes!

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:46.920
<i>Among the mountains ablaze in green,</i>

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:58.620
<i>We can hear echoes of laughter</i>

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:10.800
<i>Our voices now ring out in song:</i>

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:22.860
<i>Asahigaoka, our dear friend</i>

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:46.890
<i>Our school, bathed in gentle sunlight,</i>

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:58.600
<i>We will never forget you</i>

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:10.770
<i>Even after we fledge to the vast skies</i>

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:22.730
<i>Asahigaoka, our dear friend</i>

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:49.090
Okay, everyone come up and 
get your new textbooks.

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:50.370
Okay!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.690
Ren-chon, you get one of these, too.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:53.690
<b>Toolbox</b>

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:55.680
What's this?

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:56.900
A toolbox.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:21:00.040
It has all kinds of things 
you'll use for class in it.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:02.190
And this is your recorder.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.100
A recorder?!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.440
I'm a first grader!

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:47.490
Hotaru, come give me a hand.

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:49.160
O-Okay!

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:58.540
Hey, Mom?

00:21:58.540 --> 00:21:59.480
What?

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.810
Do you think I'll make 
friends at my new school?

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:04.690
I will, right?

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:16.460
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:21.550
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:44.100
<i>Th-The Last-Second Grab!</i>

00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:45.040
<i>That's right!</i>

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:49.350
<i>And I'll show you the 
purpose of that right now!</i>

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:52.670
<i>Pechi!</i>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>We Went to Look at the Stars</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
<b>Non Non Biyori
Repeat</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Photo: Hibuntei

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Please Watch Again
